OL,3,AArrest made over the death of black
OL,4,Awoman found hanged from tree in
OL,5,AMississippi
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This story contains
OL,8,Fdistressing details
OL,10,FPolice in the US state of Mississippi
OL,11,Fhave arrested a man in connection with
OL,12,Fthe death of a black woman found hanged
OL,13,Ffrom a tree, and say they could soon
OL,14,Ftake more people into custody.
OL,16,FTasia Fortune's body was found in the
OL,17,Flot of an abandoned home in Jackson in
OL,18,FAugust, but police only announced they
OL,19,Fwere treating her death as a possible
OL,20,Fhomicide earlier this week.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
