OL,6,
OL,7,F"That arrest today is an important
OL,8,Fdevelopment in this investigation, but
OL,9,Fit is not the conclusion," Jackson
OL,10,FPolice Chief RaShall Brackney said on
OL,11,FFriday. "This case remains active."
